Z||000000||V8Fiero||08-26-2001||11:31 PM||||You know Im a pretty patient person, but it seems that whenever I order something from them (dont order much at all) it is backordered. <P>I ordered some lowering springs for my 86 GT and they said they would be backordered for 3 weeks. No problem. Well I got the rear springs within a week. GREAT. The fronts should follow pretty soon, Right? WRONG! I get a letter saying it would be at least another month. CRAP!! I want to get the springs put on before winter and Im setting here with just the rears. Sorry to vent. Anyone else have the same predicament with them?????<P>Scott||||reg||1
