Z||000009||87GTZ34||08-29-2001||12:22 PM||||They suck!!! And now they ruined ( I mean acquired ) carparts which was fairly decent to deal with.  I placed an order last Fri. and I got an order number but when I track it nothing is there.  HELLO is anybody home???  I call 'support' (moral support I guess) and the sweet voiced woman tells me that sorry but now there is a 1 week processing time and then they will know what's in stock and what can ship.  So I said OK fine I'll cancel the order cause I need the stuff (yeah that's right, that's why I ordered it in the 1st place).  Anyway, she says sure fine as soon as the order 'processes' you can cancel then.  Huh?!?  Oh... Kay... when will that be?  She says usually about a week. Doh  Great prices though....   Anyway, who's had good luch lately with the online auto parts retailers and which ones.<P>tanks for letting me vent on your thread||||reg||1
