Z||000011||Doni Hagan||08-29-2001||09:19 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>They used to be in downtown Chicago. I've went there 100s of times. They did have a few cool vintage cars displayed in there showroom.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR> <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>According to legend, the cars belonged to the owner of the company and were all purchased by him WHEN THEY WERE NEW!! They included a '32 V-16 Caddy Phaeton and a 41 Lincoln Continental droptop that still make me drool just thinking about them. <P>When the old man died, the kids apparantly took over the business and turned it into the paragon of customer service it is today.  <P>||||reg||1
